        ['num' => '12', 'title' => 'Flash and Boost listings', 'body' => "12.1 The seller may publish a product listing visible to users in their city. A Flash listing lasts 24 hours and is free. A Boost listing lasts 3, 7, 15 or 30 days according to the prices shown in the app.\n12.2 A Boost listing only goes live after the Mobile Money operator confirms the payment. A failed or abandoned payment is not charged.\n12.3 When the chosen duration ends, the listing is no longer visible. It remains recorded in the seller's history, and the seller may republish it.\n12.4 The seller guarantees the accuracy of the listing and the right to sell the product. Contents prohibited under article 11 are forbidden. KoliGo may suspend or remove any non-compliant or reported listing without notice.\n12.5 The price of a Boost is not refundable, including when the listing is suspended or removed by KoliGo.\n12.6 The sale between seller and buyer remains their responsibility; KoliGo does not collect the product price."],
